# Environment.
# Committed (public values only, localhost): .env.example, .env.development, .env.test,
# .env.e2e.example
# Never committed: a bare .env, local overrides, the deploy-supplied
# staging/production values, and .env.e2e (local isolated-E2E-backend URL +
# seeded test credentials — M8 Phase 1A, ADR-0042). Secrets never belong in
# frontend config (FTA §14).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.staging
.env.production
.env.e2e

